# binance-future-hunter — Core

Codebase **matang** (~90 src + ~90 test). Jangan buat "struktur folder awal", Docker, Telegraf bot, atau CI GitHub→VPS.

## Stack nyata

| Layer | Lokasi | Deploy |
|---|---|---|
| Worker MCP + cron | `src/`, `wrangler.toml` | `npx wrangler deploy` (manual) |
| D1 | `migrations/` | `wrangler d1 migrations apply … --remote` |
| KV config | `CONFIG_KV` | jarang write |
| REST relay | `proxy-standalone/` | AWS VPS systemd (+ Caddy); Vercel = legacy |
| WS stream | `stream-gateway/` | AWS VPS systemd + Caddy (bukan Docker) |

Telegram = outbound notifier (`src/telegram.ts`). Stage 4 rencana `notify.ts` — belum ada.

## Agen (lihat `agents.mdc`)

| Nama | Peran |
|---|---|
| Semeru | Claude Code — architect, spec, verifikasi lokal |
| **Rinjani** | Cursor default — koding, test, commit/PR |
| **Krakatau** | Deploy/infra — HANYA setelah user acc eksplisit |

## Semeru vs Rinjani vs Krakatau

- **Semeru:** `typecheck` + `npm test` + `wrangler dev` lokal — tanpa `--remote`, deploy, SSH, secrets
- **Rinjani:** implementasi, refactor, test, siapkan branch `rinjani/<slug>`, trailer `Agent: Rinjani`
- **Krakatau:** migrate `--remote`, deploy, secret put, SSH — branch `krakatau/<slug>`, trailer `Agent: Krakatau`; **minta acc dulu**, jangan gabung dengan diff Rinjani

## Larangan umum

- No new npm deps (runtime: `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` + `zod` saja)
- Jangan rename tool `whalescope_*` (backward compat MCP)
- Jangan hardcode secret/token
- Jangan commit/deploy tanpa user minta

Dokumen: `README.md`, `docs/full_pipeline_framework.md`, `CLAUDE.md`
